- › Logistics employee 
 €16.49 Den Bosch ⏰ 36-40 uur Fulltime Logistiek 
 Over de functie 
Join My Jewellery as a Logistics Employee in Den Bosch! ✨ 
Do you have logistics experience and are you looking for a new challenge? My Jewellery is looking for a full-time Logistics Employee to join our distribution center in Den Bosch. 
You'll work 40 hours per week in a fixed two-shift rotation, alternating weekly between: - 06:00 AM - 03:00 PM - 03:00 PM - 12:00 AM 
Together with your team, you'll make sure customer orders are picked, processed, and prepared for shipment accurately and on time. 
 Jouw nieuwe werkplek 
As an Order Picker, you are an essential part of the logistics team. You make sure customer orders are picked correctly and ready for shipment. With a handheld scanner and order cart, you'll navigate the warehouse and collect the required products. Your accuracy and eye for detail help ensure every order is complete and delivered on time. 
Pick and collect orders using a handheld scanner 
Transport picked products to the packing department 
Check orders for accuracy, completeness, and quality 
Support the team with processing returned items 
 Dit bieden wij jou 
✅ An attractive hourly wage of €16.49 , including shift allowance (approximately €2,860 gross per month based on 40 hours); 
✅ A clear and fixed work schedule; 
✅ A modern warehouse with a great working atmosphere; 
✅ A young and enthusiastic team; 
✅ Career growth opportunities, for example towards Operator or Inventory Controller positions; 
✅ The opportunity to obtain a Forklift or Reach Truck Certificate; 
✅ Travel allowance and free safety shoes through Westerduin; 
✅ Holiday pay, paid vacation days, and pension accrual; 
✅ Healthy meals available through the AH to go vending machine. 
 Dit vragen wij van jou 
✔ Available to start immediately; 
✔ At least 2 years of logistics experience; 
✔ Good command of Dutch or English. 
Romy de Laat 
Recruiter 
Hoe kan ik je...

Are you looking for a varied job in logistics? We are looking for enthusiastic logistics staff on behalf of a client in Venray. You will work in a modern warehouse and, together with your colleagues, ensure that all orders are processed correctly and on time.

Functieomschrijving:
What will you be doing?
• Receiving and storing goods using a scanner;
• Picking orders and packing them carefully;
• Sorting parcels and preparing consignments;
• Restocking shelves using a reach truck, if certified;
• Checking product quality;
• Ensuring a tidy and safe working environment;
• Identifying any issues and reporting them to your line manager.

Functievereisten:
What are we looking for?
• You have your own transport to Venray;
• You can hold a simple conversation in English with your colleagues.
• You are willing to work shifts;
• You work accurately and have an eye for quality;
• You are responsible and a good team player;

Arbeidsvoorwaarden:
What do we offer you?
• €14.99 &ndash; €16.28 gross per hour as a logistics assistant;
• €15.59 &ndash; €16.88 gross per hour as a reach truck driver;
• 33% bonus on every hour worked in excess of 40 hours;
• Pension scheme and staff discount;
• A fun and informal working atmosphere;
• Opportunities for personal development.
Would you like to work in a varied warehouse environment, be part of a friendly team and develop your skills in logistics? Apply now and who knows &ndash; you might be starting in Venray before you know it!

